Hi,
LOO return by Stan is not the real "leave one participant out cross validation", Loo approximate the real cross validation by using importance sampling algorithm. For details, you can check this paper:

Vehtari, A., Gelman, A., and Gabry, J. (2017a). Practical Bayesian model evaluation using leave-one-out cross-validation and WAIC. Statistics and Computing. 27(5), 1413--1432. doi:10.1007/s11222-016-9696-4 (journal version <https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11222-016-9696-4>, preprint arXiv:1507.04544 <https://arxiv.org/abs/1507.04544>).

